alternatives: A shallower recess stops the guard before the four body lands seat and before the poles meet. A deeper recess consumes the 3 mm housing before the cured side keys; widening it changes the retained radial guidance. Removing the moving guard exposes more magnet edge and changes its insertion protection. The specified recess retains this mating envelope, with physical fit and chipping qualification still open.
