alternatives: Aligning the pilot floor to the wall-recess plane shortens relief to 0.85 mm and nominal screw-tip room to 0.50 mm. A through pilot removes the blind end but is not required by this depth/stack. Neither alternative corrects a 0.40 mm material wall, because none exists.
